      "values:originalText": "Subject to section 2, each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this\nAct is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the\nSchedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act\nhas effect according to its terms.\n\nNew Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards)\nAct 1999  Schedule 1\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000\nNo. 142, 2000            3",
