      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A reference in this Part to Australia includes a reference to:\n\n(a) the Territory of Christmas Island; and\n\n(b) the Territory of Cocos (Keeling) Islands; and\n\n(c) an external Territory specified in the regulations.\n\n(2) The definition of Australia in section 7 of the Telecommunications\nAct 1997 does not apply to this Part.",
