      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A reference in this Part to an approved auditor is a reference to a\nperson included in a class of persons specified in a written\ndetermination made by the ACA for the purposes of this section.\n\n(2) A copy of the determination must be published in the Gazette.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A reference in this Part to an approved auditor is a reference to a\nperson included in a class of persons specified in a written\ndetermination made by the ACA for the purposes of this section.\n\n(2) A copy of the determination must be published in the Gazette.",
