      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8F Meaning of approved auditor",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A reference in this Part to an approved auditor is a reference to a\nperson included in a class of persons specified in a written\ndetermination made by the ACA for the purposes of this section.\n\n(2) A copy of the determination must be published in the Gazette."
    },
