      "cml:integrityHash": "4e5de5bfbdb219811848f4176cf8ab4ee1905314c5301957a091343c6fca15ae",
      "skos:note": "Universal service obligation includes supply of standard telephone services, payphones, and carriage services on request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-9-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9(2) Universal service obligation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(2) To the extent necessary to achieve the obligation mentioned in\nsubsection (1), the universal service obligation includes:\n\n(a) the supply of standard telephone services to people in\nAustralia on request; and\n\n(b) the supply, installation and maintenance of payphones in\nAustralia; and\n\n(c) the supply of prescribed carriage services to people in\nAustralia on request."
    },
