    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9C Payphones",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-9c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Part, a payphone is a fixed telephone that:\n\n(a) is a means by which a standard telephone service is supplied;\nand\n\n(b) when in normal working order, cannot be used to make a\ntelephone call (other than a free call or a call made with\noperator assistance) unless, as payment for the call, or to\nenable payment for the call to be collected:\n\n(i) money, or a token, card or other object, has been put\ninto a device that forms part of, is attached to, or is\nlocated near, the telephone; or\n\n(ii) an identification number, or a code or other information\n(in numerical or any other form) has been input into a\ndevice that forms part of, is attached to, or is located\nnear, the telephone; or\n\n(iii) a prescribed act has been done.",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Part, a payphone is a fixed telephone that:\n\n(a) is a means by which a standard telephone service is supplied;\nand\n\n(b) when in normal working order, cannot be used to make a\ntelephone call (other than a free call or a call made with\noperator assistance) unless, as payment for the call, or to\nenable payment for the call to be collected:\n\n(i) money, or a token, card or other object, has been put\ninto a device that forms part of, is attached to, or is\nlocated near, the telephone; or\n\n(ii) an identification number, or a code or other information\n(in numerical or any other form) has been input into a\ndevice that forms part of, is attached to, or is located\nnear, the telephone; or\n\n(iii) a prescribed act has been done.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9c-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-9c-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5ab46a2ab6bb081b16b39b638fb84ede3efd00bee051c67a1c52d961f5c7cd84",
      "skos:note": "Payment is required for telephone calls made from a payphone.",
      "dc:description": "money, token, card or object"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-9c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9C Payphones",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Part, a payphone is a fixed telephone that:\n\n(a) is a means by which a standard telephone service is supplied;\nand\n\n(b) when in normal working order, cannot be used to make a\ntelephone call (other than a free call or a call made with\noperator assistance) unless, as payment for the call, or to\nenable payment for the call to be collected:\n\n(i) money, or a token, card or other object, has been put\ninto a device that forms part of, is attached to, or is\nlocated near, the telephone; or\n\n(ii) an identification number, or a code or other information\n(in numerical or any other form) has been input into a\ndevice that forms part of, is attached to, or is located\nnear, the telephone; or\n\n(iii) a prescribed act has been done."
    },
