      "skos:note": "Determination is disallowable instrument"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-12-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12(5) Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A determination under this section is a disallowable instrument for\nthe purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.\nNote:\nA determination that the Minister is taken to have made under this\nsection because of section 12E is not a disallowable instrument (see\nsubsection 12E(6))."
