      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9J Transitional arrangements may be determined",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Minister revokes a determination under section 9G, the\nMinister may determine in writing arrangements to deal with any\nissues of a transitional nature that may arise as a result of the\nrevocation.\n\n(2) A copy of a determination under subsection (1) must be published\nin the Gazette."
    },
