      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, the general digital data service\nobligation is the obligation to ensure that general digital data\nservices are reasonably accessible to all people in general digital\ndata service areas on an equitable basis.\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, the general digital data service\nobligation is the obligation to ensure that general digital data\nservices are reasonably accessible to all people in general digital\ndata service areas on an equitable basis.\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
