    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10C Supply of customer equipment or other goods or services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-10c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An obligation does not arise under subsection 10A(2) in relation to\nparticular equipment, goods or services the supply of which is\ntreated under subsection 10F(1) as the supply of a general digital\ndata service if the customer concerned requests not to be supplied\nwith the equipment, goods or services.\n\n(2) An obligation does not arise under subsection 10B(2) in relation to\nparticular equipment, goods or services the supply of which is\ntreated under subsection 10G(1) as the supply of a special digital\ndata service if the customer concerned requests not to be supplied\nwith the equipment, goods or services.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An obligation does not arise under subsection 10A(2) in relation to\nparticular equipment, goods or services the supply of which is\ntreated under subsection 10F(1) as the supply of a general digital\ndata service if the customer concerned requests not to be supplied\nwith the equipment, goods or services.\n\n(2) An obligation does not arise under subsection 10B(2) in relation to\nparticular equipment, goods or services the supply of which is\ntreated under subsection 10G(1) as the supply of a special digital\ndata service if the customer concerned requests not to be supplied\nwith the equipment, goods or services.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10c-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ee2d0d602de0b2f527f49110bd8826972d72730ad1357c75614d79d2d1498575"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-10c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10C Supply of customer equipment or other goods or services",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An obligation does not arise under subsection 10A(2) in relation to\nparticular equipment, goods or services the supply of which is\ntreated under subsection 10F(1) as the supply of a general digital\ndata service if the customer concerned requests not to be supplied\nwith the equipment, goods or services.\n\n(2) An obligation does not arise under subsection 10B(2) in relation to\nparticular equipment, goods or services the supply of which is\ntreated under subsection 10G(1) as the supply of a special digital\ndata service if the customer concerned requests not to be supplied\nwith the equipment, goods or services."
    },
