    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10E Digital data services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-10e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a digital data service is:\n\n(a) a general digital data service (see subsection (2)); or\n\n(b) a special digital data service (see subsection (3)).\nGeneral digital data service\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, a general digital data service is a\ncarriage service that provides a digital data capability broadly\ncomparable to that provided by a data channel with a data\ntransmission speed of 64 kilobits per second supplied to end-users\nas part of the designated basic rate ISDN service.\nSpecial digital data service\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Act, a special digital data service is a\ncarriage service that provides for a capability for the delivery of\ndigital data to an end-user broadly comparable to the\ncorresponding capability provided by a data channel with a data\ntransmission speed of 64 kilobits per second supplied to end-users\nas part of the designated basic rate ISDN service.\nDesignated basic rate ISDN service\n\n(4) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a digital data service is:\n\n(a) a general digital data service (see subsection (2)); or\n\n(b) a special digital data service (see subsection (3)).\nGeneral digital data service\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, a general digital data service is a\ncarriage service that provides a digital data capability broadly\ncomparable to that provided by a data channel with a data\ntransmission speed of 64 kilobits per second supplied to end-users\nas part of the designated basic rate ISDN service.\nSpecial digital data service\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Act, a special digital data service is a\ncarriage service that provides for a capability for the delivery of\ndigital data to an end-user broadly comparable to the\ncorresponding capability provided by a data channel with a data\ntransmission speed of 64 kilobits per second supplied to end-users\nas part of the designated basic rate ISDN service.\nDesignated basic rate ISDN service\n\n(4) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10e-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10e-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10e-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10e-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c409e608841f610d7b29c10647ffd99caa5cd19a8c93ff3742cd9a3063a57afc"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-10e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10E Digital data services",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a digital data service is:\n\n(a) a general digital data service (see subsection (2)); or\n\n(b) a special digital data service (see subsection (3)).\nGeneral digital data service\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, a general digital data service is a\ncarriage service that provides a digital data capability broadly\ncomparable to that provided by a data channel with a data\ntransmission speed of 64 kilobits per second supplied to end-users\nas part of the designated basic rate ISDN service.\nSpecial digital data service\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Act, a special digital data service is a\ncarriage service that provides for a capability for the delivery of\ndigital data to an end-user broadly comparable to the\ncorresponding capability provided by a data channel with a data\ntransmission speed of 64 kilobits per second supplied to end-users\nas part of the designated basic rate ISDN service.\nDesignated basic rate ISDN service\n\n(4) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999"
    },
