    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16 Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-16"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000\n\n(a) immediately before 1 July 1997, Telstra supplied a basic rate\nIntegrated Services Digital Network (ISDN) service; and\n\n(b) the service complied with any of the standards for ISDN\nservices made by the European Telecommunications\nStandards Institute (ETSI);\nthe service is a designated basic rate ISDN service.\nComparability of digital data capability\n\n(5) For the purposes of subsection (2), the determination of the\ncomparability of the digital data capability of a carriage service is\nto be based solely on a comparison of the data transmission speed\navailable to an end-user of the service.",
      "skos:definition": "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000\n\n(a) immediately before 1 July 1997, Telstra supplied a basic rate\nIntegrated Services Digital Network (ISDN) service; and\n\n(b) the service complied with any of the standards for ISDN\nservices made by the European Telecommunications\nStandards Institute (ETSI);\nthe service is a designated basic rate ISDN service.\nComparability of digital data capability\n\n(5) For the purposes of subsection (2), the determination of the\ncomparability of the digital data capability of a carriage service is\nto be based solely on a comparison of the data transmission speed\navailable to an end-user of the service.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "856f9591245e72d33c77c2e36c27e4e9f17fa44f828692e51417eaa8472fde1f",
      "skos:note": "Telstra must supply a basic rate ISDN service that complies with ETSI standards.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-16",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16 Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000\n\n(a) immediately before 1 July 1997, Telstra supplied a basic rate\nIntegrated Services Digital Network (ISDN) service; and\n\n(b) the service complied with any of the standards for ISDN\nservices made by the European Telecommunications\nStandards Institute (ETSI);\nthe service is a designated basic rate ISDN service.\nComparability of digital data capability\n\n(5) For the purposes of subsection (2), the determination of the\ncomparability of the digital data capability of a carriage service is\nto be based solely on a comparison of the data transmission speed\navailable to an end-user of the service."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
