      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e) may require\nthat the supply of a specified kind of customer equipment is to be\nby way of hire. If those regulations impose such a requirement, this\nPart has effect, in relation to the customer equipment concerned, as\nif a reference to supply were a reference to supply by way of hire.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e) may require\nthat the supply of a specified kind of customer equipment is to be\nby way of hire. If those regulations impose such a requirement, this\nPart has effect, in relation to the customer equipment concerned, as\nif a reference to supply were a reference to supply by way of hire.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10g"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
