        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10g-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "869d3564d6980728009c301f4e66e294639d9ac601f60f0a00f6d101c832f43f",
      "skos:note": "Regulations may require supply of customer equipment by way of hire."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-10g-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10G(2) Supply of special digital data services",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 21,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e) may require\nthat the supply of a specified kind of customer equipment is to be\nby way of hire. If those regulations impose such a requirement, this\nPart has effect, in relation to the customer equipment concerned, as\nif a reference to supply were a reference to supply by way of hire."
    },
