    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20(6) Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-20-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Minister may make a written determination to the effect that,\neither generally or in a particular case, information of a kind\nspecified in the determination is taken to be information that will\nassist a person in doing a specified thing that the person is or will\nbe required or permitted to do by or under a provision of this Part.\nThe determination has effect accordingly.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Minister may make a written determination to the effect that,\neither generally or in a particular case, information of a kind\nspecified in the determination is taken to be information that will\nassist a person in doing a specified thing that the person is or will\nbe required or permitted to do by or under a provision of this Part.\nThe determination has effect accordingly.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e76d67cfa0aa7d64452109028379d03e31810c84a3a68025b3d4e38f056290a9",
      "skos:note": "The Minister may make a written determination to assist a person in doing something."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-20-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20(6) Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Minister may make a written determination to the effect that,\neither generally or in a particular case, information of a kind\nspecified in the determination is taken to be information that will\nassist a person in doing a specified thing that the person is or will\nbe required or permitted to do by or under a provision of this Part.\nThe determination has effect accordingly."
    },
