      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Before the Minister can make any determination under section 11C\nin relation to a pilot area, the Minister must have determined under\nsection 9G one or more universal service areas that cover the\nwhole of the pilot area.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Before the Minister can make any determination under section 11C\nin relation to a pilot area, the Minister must have determined under\nsection 9G one or more universal service areas that cover the\nwhole of the pilot area.",
