      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may determine:\n\n(a) different primary universal service providers in respect of\ndifferent service obligations for the same universal service\narea; and\n\n(b) the same person as the primary universal service provider for\none or more universal service areas in respect of one or more\nservice obligations.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Minister may determine:\n\n(a) different primary universal service providers in respect of\ndifferent service obligations for the same universal service\narea; and\n\n(b) the same person as the primary universal service provider for\none or more universal service areas in respect of one or more\nservice obligations.",
