      "skos:note": "Minister may determine different primary universal service providers for same universal service area."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-12a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12A(2) Determination of primary universal service providers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may determine:\n\n(a) different primary universal service providers in respect of\ndifferent service obligations for the same universal service\narea; and\n\n(b) the same person as the primary universal service provider for\none or more universal service areas in respect of one or more\nservice obligations."
    },
