      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In deciding whether to make a determination that a person is a\nprimary universal service provider, the Minister is limited to\nconsidering factors that are relevant to achieving the objects of this\nAct.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In deciding whether to make a determination that a person is a\nprimary universal service provider, the Minister is limited to\nconsidering factors that are relevant to achieving the objects of this\nAct.",
