      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister is taken to have properly made:\n\n(a) a determination under section 9G that each of the areas,\nspecified in the agreement as a universal service area in\nrespect of a service obligation, is a universal service area in\nrespect of that service obligation for the purposes of this Act;\nand\n\n(b) a determination under section 12A that the person is a\nprimary universal service provider for each of the areas, in\nrespect of the service obligation or obligations, specified in\nthe agreement.\nThose determinations are referred to in this section as deemed\ndeterminations.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Minister is taken to have properly made:\n\n(a) a determination under section 9G that each of the areas,\nspecified in the agreement as a universal service area in\nrespect of a service obligation, is a universal service area in\nrespect of that service obligation for the purposes of this Act;\nand\n\n(b) a determination under section 12A that the person is a\nprimary universal service provider for each of the areas, in\nrespect of the service obligation or obligations, specified in\nthe agreement.\nThose determinations are referred to in this section as deemed\ndeterminations.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12e-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12e-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c02432da4a07784acb4a66570be36bfaeb9d74e4abbc9bfea9c775f52d084518",
      "skos:note": "Minister's deemed determinations under sections 9G and 12A."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-12e-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12E(2) Effect of certain agreements under the Telstra Corporation Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister is taken to have properly made:\n\n(a) a determination under section 9G that each of the areas,\nspecified in the agreement as a universal service area in\nrespect of a service obligation, is a universal service area in\nrespect of that service obligation for the purposes of this Act;\nand\n\n(b) a determination under section 12A that the person is a\nprimary universal service provider for each of the areas, in\nrespect of the service obligation or obligations, specified in\nthe agreement.\nThose determinations are referred to in this section as deemed\ndeterminations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12e-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
