    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12e-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "12E(3) Effect of certain agreements under the Telstra Corporation Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-12e-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The deemed determinations take effect as follows:\n\n(a) if the commencement date (see subsection (4)) is the same\nfor each of the areas—they take effect on that\ncommencement date; or\n\n(b) if there are different commencement dates for different\nareas—they take effect for those different areas on those\ndifferent dates.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The deemed determinations take effect as follows:\n\n(a) if the commencement date (see subsection (4)) is the same\nfor each of the areas—they take effect on that\ncommencement date; or\n\n(b) if there are different commencement dates for different\nareas—they take effect for those different areas on those\ndifferent dates.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12e-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12e-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2602558e0f48ef950b72c12cbfde6aa52f02893fe4a48559ec4d201e5c9cd51d",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement of deemed determinations"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-12e-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12E(3) Effect of certain agreements under the Telstra Corporation Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The deemed determinations take effect as follows:\n\n(a) if the commencement date (see subsection (4)) is the same\nfor each of the areas—they take effect on that\ncommencement date; or\n\n(b) if there are different commencement dates for different\nareas—they take effect for those different areas on those\ndifferent dates."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12e-ss-3-norm",
