      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may determine in writing requirements for draft\npolicy statements and draft standard marketing plans of primary\nuniversal service providers.\n\n(2) These are some examples of requirements in relation to draft\nstandard marketing plans:\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may determine in writing requirements for draft\npolicy statements and draft standard marketing plans of primary\nuniversal service providers.\n\n(2) These are some examples of requirements in relation to draft\nstandard marketing plans:\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
