    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-12j-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12J(1) Public consultation required on draft policy statement and draft",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 34,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Before giving the ACA a draft policy statement or draft standard\nmarketing plan, a primary universal service provider must:\n\n(a) publish a preliminary version of the draft and invite members\nof the public to make submissions to the provider about the\npreliminary version within a specified period (which must be\nat least 30 days); and\n\n(b) give consideration to any submissions received from\nmembers of the public within that period."
