      "values:originalText": "(3) However, this section does not apply to a fresh draft policy\nstatement, or fresh draft standard marketing plan, given to the ACA\nby a primary universal service provider in accordance with a\ndirection under paragraph 12M(2)(b) unless the ACA notifies the\nprovider in writing that it does apply to the document.",
