        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-12w-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.41",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Before deciding whether to approve the variation, the ACA may, if\nthe ACA considers it appropriate, require the provider:\n\n(a) to publish a preliminary version of the draft variation and\ninvite members of the public to make submissions to the\nprovider about the preliminary version within a specified\nperiod; and\n\n(b) to give consideration to any submissions from members of\nthe public received within that period; and\n\n(c) to advise the ACA on those submissions and any changes\nmade to the draft variation as a result.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Before deciding whether to approve the variation, the ACA may, if\nthe ACA considers it appropriate, require the provider:\n\n(a) to publish a preliminary version of the draft variation and\ninvite members of the public to make submissions to the\nprovider about the preliminary version within a specified\nperiod; and\n\n(b) to give consideration to any submissions from members of\nthe public received within that period; and\n\n(c) to advise the ACA on those submissions and any changes\nmade to the draft variation as a result.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12w"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12w-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-12w-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "180a65c115a5b2668fb33734ed8ee0e88acc4f780c8a548293bf2dda5fa0071f",
      "skos:note": "Provider must consider public submissions before advising ACA on draft variation.",
      "dc:description": "Submissions from members of the public"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-12w-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12W(3) Variation of approved policy statement, approved standard",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 41,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Before deciding whether to approve the variation, the ACA may, if\nthe ACA considers it appropriate, require the provider:\n\n(a) to publish a preliminary version of the draft variation and\ninvite members of the public to make submissions to the\nprovider about the preliminary version within a specified\nperiod; and\n\n(b) to give consideration to any submissions from members of\nthe public received within that period; and\n\n(c) to advise the ACA on those submissions and any changes\nmade to the draft variation as a result."
    },
