      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the ACA approves the variation:\n\n(a) the current statement or plan is varied accordingly; and\n\n(b) a copy of the notice given to the provider must be published\nin the Gazette, unless the variation is only of a minor\ntechnical nature.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the ACA approves the variation:\n\n(a) the current statement or plan is varied accordingly; and\n\n(b) a copy of the notice given to the provider must be published\nin the Gazette, unless the variation is only of a minor\ntechnical nature.",
