      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.43",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister may determine in writing arrangements to deal with\nissues of a transitional nature that may arise as a result of the\nrevocation. A copy of the determination must be:\n\n(a) given to the provider; and\n\n(b) published in the Gazette.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Minister may determine in writing arrangements to deal with\nissues of a transitional nature that may arise as a result of the\nrevocation. A copy of the determination must be:\n\n(a) given to the provider; and\n\n(b) published in the Gazette.",
