      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.43",
      "values:originalText": "The standard contestability arrangements consist of the\narrangements set out in this Division.\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
