      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.44",
      "values:originalText": "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000\nNote:\nThese apply to universal service areas in respect of a contestable\nservice obligation or obligations (see subsection 11(3)).\nSubdivision B—Competing universal service providers",
      "skos:definition": "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000\nNote:\nThese apply to universal service areas in respect of a contestable\nservice obligation or obligations (see subsection 11(3)).\nSubdivision B—Competing universal service providers",
      "cml:asserts": [
