      "skos:definition": "(2) The application must be in the form approved in writing by the\nACA and must be accompanied by:\n\n(a) a draft policy statement, or draft variation of an approved\npolicy statement; and\n\n(b) at least one of the following:\n\n(i) a draft standard marketing plan;\n\n(ii) a draft ATS marketing plan; and\n\n(c) such information or documents as are required by the\napproved form.\nNote 1:\nFor the meaning of draft policy statement and approved policy\nstatement, see section 13F.\nNote 2:\nFor the meaning of draft ATS marketing plan, see section 13M.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13a-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "80a20110f6e84871237019fab0dd2df394c298097a1ba9a64c43db26ce76132c",
      "skos:note": "Application must be in approved form with required documents and information.",
      "dc:description": "draft policy statement, draft standard marketing plan, or draft ATS marketing plan"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-13a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13A(2) Application to be approved as a competing universal service",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 44,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The application must be in the form approved in writing by the\nACA and must be accompanied by:\n\n(a) a draft policy statement, or draft variation of an approved\npolicy statement; and\n\n(b) at least one of the following:\n\n(i) a draft standard marketing plan;\n\n(ii) a draft ATS marketing plan; and\n\n(c) such information or documents as are required by the\napproved form.\nNote 1:\nFor the meaning of draft policy statement and approved policy\nstatement, see section 13F.\nNote 2:\nFor the meaning of draft ATS marketing plan, see section 13M."
    },
