    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13e-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13E(3) Surrender of approval as a competing universal service",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-13e-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "(3) After receiving the notice, the ACA may determine in writing:\n\n(a) the date on which the provider’s approval as a competing\nuniversal service provider in respect of that contestable\nservice obligation ceases to have effect; and\n\n(b) that section 13D does not apply, to the extent specified in the\ndetermination, to the provider from the day on which the\nACA received the notice or a later day specified in the\ndetermination.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) After receiving the notice, the ACA may determine in writing:\n\n(a) the date on which the provider’s approval as a competing\nuniversal service provider in respect of that contestable\nservice obligation ceases to have effect; and\n\n(b) that section 13D does not apply, to the extent specified in the\ndetermination, to the provider from the day on which the\nACA received the notice or a later day specified in the\ndetermination.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13e-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d33f8481e0f262b744be6b557c17cb7a0ffe331b0f256d2b53ea18a7659eff98",
      "skos:note": "Determination of provider's approval as a competing universal service provider"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-13e-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13E(3) Surrender of approval as a competing universal service",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 47,
      "values:originalText": "(3) After receiving the notice, the ACA may determine in writing:\n\n(a) the date on which the provider’s approval as a competing\nuniversal service provider in respect of that contestable\nservice obligation ceases to have effect; and\n\n(b) that section 13D does not apply, to the extent specified in the\ndetermination, to the provider from the day on which the\nACA received the notice or a later day specified in the\ndetermination."
    },
