      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The ACA must not approve the draft unless it is satisfied that the\ndraft adequately deals with the supply of appropriate equipment,\ngoods or services to:\n\n(a) people with a disability; and\n\n(b) people with special needs.\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The ACA must not approve the draft unless it is satisfied that the\ndraft adequately deals with the supply of appropriate equipment,\ngoods or services to:\n\n(a) people with a disability; and\n\n(b) people with special needs.\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13j-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13j-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "331db3f07a8941bc9894eed710781bb8252ee8a7d235d2dcd6fa4374520eafa1",
      "skos:note": "The ACA must approve the draft policy statement if it adequately deals with supply of equipment, goods or services for people with a disability and special needs."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-13j-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13J(2) Approval of draft policy statement",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The ACA must not approve the draft unless it is satisfied that the\ndraft adequately deals with the supply of appropriate equipment,\ngoods or services to:\n\n(a) people with a disability; and\n\n(b) people with special needs.\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13j-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
