    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13l",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13L Notice of decision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-13l"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACA must give written notice of the ACA’s decision whether\nto approve a draft policy statement, or draft standard marketing\nplan, given to the ACA by an applicant for approval as a\ncompeting universal service provider.\n\n(2) If the ACA refuses to approve the draft, the ACA must give the\napplicant written notice of the reasons for that refusal.\n\n(3) A copy of a notice under subsection (1), if the decision is to\napprove the draft, must be published in the Gazette.\nSubdivision D—ATS marketing plans of competing universal\nservice providers",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The ACA must give written notice of the ACA’s decision whether\nto approve a draft policy statement, or draft standard marketing\nplan, given to the ACA by an applicant for approval as a\ncompeting universal service provider.\n\n(2) If the ACA refuses to approve the draft, the ACA must give the\napplicant written notice of the reasons for that refusal.\n\n(3) A copy of a notice under subsection (1), if the decision is to\napprove the draft, must be published in the Gazette.\nSubdivision D—ATS marketing plans of competing universal\nservice providers",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-13l-ss-1"
