      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A draft ATS marketing plan that has been approved by the ACA\nunder section 13Q, and that is in force, is an approved ATS\nmarketing plan for the applicant or competing universal service\nprovider concerned.",
