      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Each draft or approved ATS marketing plan must cover only one\nuniversal service area and only one contestable service obligation.\nHowever, the ACA may determine in writing that this subsection\ndoes not apply to:\n\n(a) draft or approved ATS marketing plans generally; or\n\n(b) a draft or approved ATS marketing plan of a particular\napplicant or competing universal service provider.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Each draft or approved ATS marketing plan must cover only one\nuniversal service area and only one contestable service obligation.\nHowever, the ACA may determine in writing that this subsection\ndoes not apply to:\n\n(a) draft or approved ATS marketing plans generally; or\n\n(b) a draft or approved ATS marketing plan of a particular\napplicant or competing universal service provider.",
