      "cml:integrityHash": "f732c499a682ba5d30b6877e096d4c3fb0dc38aa2f8bf5b49eed28e9410ff372",
      "skos:note": "Minister may direct variation or replacement of plan within a specified period and in specified terms.",
      "dc:description": "Draft variation of the current plan or a fresh draft digital data service plan for the area that is expressed to replace the current plan"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-15n-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15N(2) Minister may direct variation or replacement of plan",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may give the digital data service provider concerned\na written notice requiring the provider:\n\n(a) within the period and in the terms set out in the notice, to\ngive the Minister a draft variation of the current plan; or\n\n(b) within the period and in the terms set out in the notice, to\ngive the Minister a fresh draft digital data service plan for the\narea that is expressed to replace the current plan."
    },
