      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16(4) Determination of universal service subsidy",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The circumstances that may be specified include, but are not\nlimited to:\n\n(a) whether the subsidy is payable to a primary universal service\nprovider or a competing universal service provider; and\n\n(b) the types or amount of equipment, goods or services that are\nsupplied to persons in a universal service area."
    },
