      "cml:logicSummary": "Digital data cost calculation is an obligation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-17-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "17(2) Digital data cost of a digital data service provider for a claim",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-17-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The formula referred to in paragraph (1)(b) is as follows:\nCustomer\nequipment costs\nCustomer charges\nSupplementary amount\n–\n+\n\nwhere:\ncustomer charges means the total amount payable by persons in\nthe area referred to in subsection (3) by way of charges for the\nsupply by the person during the claim period of customer\nequipment covered by paragraph (3)(a).\ncustomer equipment costs means the person’s customer equipment\ncosts for the claim period.\nsupplementary amount means the amount (if any) specified in, or\nascertained in accordance with, regulations made for the purposes\nof this definition.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The formula referred to in paragraph (1)(b) is as follows:\nCustomer\nequipment costs\nCustomer charges\nSupplementary amount\n–\n+\n\nwhere:\ncustomer charges means the total amount payable by persons in\nthe area referred to in subsection (3) by way of charges for the\nsupply by the person during the claim period of customer\nequipment covered by paragraph (3)(a).\ncustomer equipment costs means the person’s customer equipment\ncosts for the claim period.\nsupplementary amount means the amount (if any) specified in, or\nascertained in accordance with, regulations made for the purposes\nof this definition.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-17"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-17-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a2b593178510ec76b395f15c09539e1bddfd1cca1e0fe3ea0b5f9009ee4bcdd0",
      "skos:note": "Customer charges and equipment costs calculation formula"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-17-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17(2) Digital data cost of a digital data service provider for a claim",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 68,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The formula referred to in paragraph (1)(b) is as follows:\nCustomer\nequipment costs\nCustomer charges\nSupplementary amount\n–\n+\n\nwhere:\ncustomer charges means the total amount payable by persons in\nthe area referred to in subsection (3) by way of charges for the\nsupply by the person during the claim period of customer\nequipment covered by paragraph (3)(a).\ncustomer equipment costs means the person’s customer equipment\ncosts for the claim period.\nsupplementary amount means the amount (if any) specified in, or\nascertained in accordance with, regulations made for the purposes\nof this definition."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-17-ss-2-norm",
