      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Division, a universal service charge is a\ncharge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the person for:\n\n(a) the supply of standard telephone services to persons in the\narea; or\n\n(b) calls made from payphones in the area; or\n\n(c) the supply of prescribed carriage services to persons in the\narea."
