    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-19",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19 Digital data service charges",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-19"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a general digital\ndata service provider for a particular area, a digital data service\ncharge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the\n\nNew Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards)\nAct 1999  Schedule 1\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000\nNo. 142, 2000            69\nperson for the supply of general digital data services to persons in\nthe area.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a special digital\ndata service provider for a particular area, a digital data service\ncharge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the\nperson for the supply of special digital data services to persons in\nthe area.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a general digital\ndata service provider for a particular area, a digital data service\ncharge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the\n\nNew Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards)\nAct 1999  Schedule 1\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000\nNo. 142, 2000            69\nperson for the supply of general digital data services to persons in\nthe area.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a special digital\ndata service provider for a particular area, a digital data service\ncharge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the\nperson for the supply of special digital data services to persons in\nthe area.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-19-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-19-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "edc4c1430a78b78545009fb976a09a1c79c632899ecbb2044b3d5a322c5ea765"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-19",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19 Digital data service charges",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 72,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a general digital\ndata service provider for a particular area, a digital data service\ncharge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the\n\nNew Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards)\nAct 1999  Schedule 1\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000\nNo. 142, 2000            69\nperson for the supply of general digital data services to persons in\nthe area.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Division, if a person is a special digital\ndata service provider for a particular area, a digital data service\ncharge is a charge imposed, or proposed to be imposed, by the\nperson for the supply of special digital data services to persons in\nthe area."
    },
