      "values:originalText": "(3) The return must set out:\n\n(a) the eligible revenue for the eligible revenue period of the\nparticipating person; and\n\n(b) details of how the eligible revenue was worked out; and\n\n(c) such other information (if any) as the approved form of\nreturn requires.\nNote:\nIt is an offence to make a false or misleading statement in connection\nwith the operation of this Act (see section 578 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The return must set out:\n\n(a) the eligible revenue for the eligible revenue period of the\nparticipating person; and\n\n(b) details of how the eligible revenue was worked out; and\n\n(c) such other information (if any) as the approved form of\nreturn requires.\nNote:\nIt is an offence to make a false or misleading statement in connection\nwith the operation of this Act (see section 578 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20-2"
      },
