    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20A Who is a participating person?",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-20a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.75",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person is a participating person for\nan eligible revenue period if:\n\n(a) the person was a carrier at any time during the eligible\nrevenue period; or\n\n(b) the Minister makes a written determination that carriage\nservice providers are participating persons for the eligible\nrevenue period and the person was a carriage service\nprovider at any time during the eligible revenue period.\n\n(2) However, a person is not a participating person for an eligible\nrevenue period if:\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a person is a participating person for\nan eligible revenue period if:\n\n(a) the person was a carrier at any time during the eligible\nrevenue period; or\n\n(b) the Minister makes a written determination that carriage\nservice providers are participating persons for the eligible\nrevenue period and the person was a carriage service\nprovider at any time during the eligible revenue period.\n\n(2) However, a person is not a participating person for an eligible\nrevenue period if:\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
