      "cof:title": "72(3) Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 76,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A determination made for the purposes of subsection (1), or\nparagraph (2)(a) or (b), is a disallowable instrument for the\npurposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."
    },
