    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20l",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20L ACA to publish claims or a summary of claims",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-20l"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.81",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Within 14 days after the end of the period for making claims for\nlevy credit for a claim period, the ACA must publish on the\nInternet or by any other means that the ACA considers appropriate:\n\n(a) a copy of each claim made under section 20J in respect of the\nclaim period; or\n\n(b) a summary of all the claims made under that section in\nrespect of the claim period.\n\n(2) In this section:\nclaim includes a variation of a claim.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Within 14 days after the end of the period for making claims for\nlevy credit for a claim period, the ACA must publish on the\nInternet or by any other means that the ACA considers appropriate:\n\n(a) a copy of each claim made under section 20J in respect of the\nclaim period; or\n\n(b) a summary of all the claims made under that section in\nrespect of the claim period.\n\n(2) In this section:\nclaim includes a variation of a claim.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20l-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20l-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fea66c091b3ccaed9a4b32def4d36cd87cba08345d85c566bee6193a70c29604"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-20l",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20L ACA to publish claims or a summary of claims",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 81,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Within 14 days after the end of the period for making claims for\nlevy credit for a claim period, the ACA must publish on the\nInternet or by any other means that the ACA considers appropriate:\n\n(a) a copy of each claim made under section 20J in respect of the\nclaim period; or\n\n(b) a summary of all the claims made under that section in\nrespect of the claim period.\n\n(2) In this section:\nclaim includes a variation of a claim."
    },
