      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20n",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20N ACA to assess levy credit",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-20n"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.81",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACA must make a written assessment, in respect of each\nperson who submits a claim for levy credit for a claim period in\naccordance with section 20J, of the person’s levy credit for that\nperiod.\nNote:\nThe assessment may be included in the same document as any other\nassessment the ACA makes under this Part (see section 20Y).\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The ACA must make a written assessment, in respect of each\nperson who submits a claim for levy credit for a claim period in\naccordance with section 20J, of the person’s levy credit for that\nperiod.\nNote:\nThe assessment may be included in the same document as any other\nassessment the ACA makes under this Part (see section 20Y).\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20n-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20n-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "520b3ec6d4841765667d1c5edb50c83ea0d13b65654ec98164f57bd0c2dfc87d",
      "skos:note": "ACA must make a written assessment of levy credit for each person submitting a claim."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-20n",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20N ACA to assess levy credit",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 81,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACA must make a written assessment, in respect of each\nperson who submits a claim for levy credit for a claim period in\naccordance with section 20J, of the person’s levy credit for that\nperiod.\nNote:\nThe assessment may be included in the same document as any other\nassessment the ACA makes under this Part (see section 20Y).\n\nSchedule 1  New Part 2 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service\nStandards) Act 1999"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20n-norm",
