      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.83",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The levy debit is the amount worked out using the formula:\nLevy contribution factor\nTotal levy credits\n×\n\nwhere:\nlevy contribution factor means the person’s levy contribution\nfactor for that eligible revenue period worked out under\nsection 20H.\ntotal levy credits means the total of all the levy credits to which\npersons are entitled for that claim period.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The levy debit is the amount worked out using the formula:\nLevy contribution factor\nTotal levy credits\n×\n\nwhere:\nlevy contribution factor means the person’s levy contribution\nfactor for that eligible revenue period worked out under\nsection 20H.\ntotal levy credits means the total of all the levy credits to which\npersons are entitled for that claim period.",
      "values:partOf": {
