      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.83",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by written determination, modify the formula in\nsubsection (2).\nNote:\nThe Minister may, for example, increase the amount of total levy\ncredits to take account of the possibility of defaults in the payment of\nlevy for a claim period.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister may, by written determination, modify the formula in\nsubsection (2).\nNote:\nThe Minister may, for example, increase the amount of total levy\ncredits to take account of the possibility of defaults in the payment of\nlevy for a claim period.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-20r"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
