      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.85",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Unless the contrary intention appears, an amended assessment is\ntaken, for the purposes of this Part, to be an assessment under\nsection 20F, 20N or 20U (as the case may be).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Unless the contrary intention appears, an amended assessment is\ntaken, for the purposes of this Part, to be an assessment under\nsection 20F, 20N or 20U (as the case may be).",
