      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 87,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A reference in this section to the Commonwealth includes a\nreference to an authority of the Commonwealth that cannot, by law\nof the Commonwealth, be made liable to taxation by the\nCommonwealth."
