      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A reference in this section to the Commonwealth includes a\nreference to an authority of the Commonwealth that cannot, by law\nof the Commonwealth, be made liable to taxation by the\nCommonwealth.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Commonwealth is not liable to levy taxation."
    },
    {
