      "skos:note": "Minister may determine arrangements for transitional issues after a change in administration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-21-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21(4) Universal Service Account",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 88,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If there is a change to who is to administer the Universal Service\nAccount in accordance with subsection (3), the Minister may\ndetermine in writing arrangements to deal with any issues of a\ntransitional nature that may arise as a result of the change."
