        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ad553e054af408ffe3c9553753dd058fc37987b20423eb27219465b5d1cfda25",
      "skos:note": "Definition of FMA Act and unamended Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-21-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21(6) Universal Service Account",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 88,
      "values:originalText": "(6) In this section:\nFMA Act means the Financial Management and Accountability\nAct 1997.\nunamended Act means this Act as in force immediately before the\ncommencement of Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications\n(Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act\n(No. 2) 2000."
    },
