      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.92",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In determining the question referred to in paragraph (4)(b), the\nACA must have regard to:\n\n(a) whether any undertakings have been given under\nsubsection (6) and, if so, the nature of those undertakings;\nand\n\n(b) such other matters (if any) as the ACA considers relevant.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In determining the question referred to in paragraph (4)(b), the\nACA must have regard to:\n\n(a) whether any undertakings have been given under\nsubsection (6) and, if so, the nature of those undertakings;\nand\n\n(b) such other matters (if any) as the ACA considers relevant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22a-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "359baed821a8b3c0288dd4d6cef9035f0e3e60154eedd91f011a636c4f4a3ecd",
      "skos:note": "Consider relevant matters when determining the question referred to in paragraph (4)(b)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-22a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22A(5) Request for information that is unavailable under section 22",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 92,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In determining the question referred to in paragraph (4)(b), the\nACA must have regard to:\n\n(a) whether any undertakings have been given under\nsubsection (6) and, if so, the nature of those undertakings;\nand\n\n(b) such other matters (if any) as the ACA considers relevant."
    },
