      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of this section, if a Register is maintained by\nelectronic means, a person is taken to have made a copy of, or\ntaken an extract from, the Register if the ACA gives the person a\nprintout of some or all of the Register.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of this section, if a Register is maintained by\nelectronic means, a person is taken to have made a copy of, or\ntaken an extract from, the Register if the ACA gives the person a\nprintout of some or all of the Register.",
