      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "A failure by the Minister or the ACA to publish a notice in the\nGazette as required by a provision of this Act does not affect the\nvalidity of anything else done in accordance with this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "A failure by the Minister or the ACA to publish a notice in the\nGazette as required by a provision of this Act does not affect the\nvalidity of anything else done in accordance with this Act.",
