    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-23d-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23D(7) Penalty for late payment of levy",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-23d-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.97",
      "values:originalText": "(7) As soon as practicable after a person fails to pay an amount of levy\nby the time by which it must be paid, the ACA must, in writing,\nnotify the person that the person is liable to a penalty under this\nsection. However, a failure to do so does not affect the person’s\nliability.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) As soon as practicable after a person fails to pay an amount of levy\nby the time by which it must be paid, the ACA must, in writing,\nnotify the person that the person is liable to a penalty under this\nsection. However, a failure to do so does not affect the person’s\nliability.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-23d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-23d-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-23d-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e863439ffe05e0cb5064701ebc7ff09e1e6e41632ed3305c6eee481582cd0cb6",
      "skos:note": "Notify person of liability for late payment of levy",
      "dc:description": "Writing"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-23d-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23D(7) Penalty for late payment of levy",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 97,
      "values:originalText": "(7) As soon as practicable after a person fails to pay an amount of levy\nby the time by which it must be paid, the ACA must, in writing,\nnotify the person that the person is liable to a penalty under this\nsection. However, a failure to do so does not affect the person’s\nliability."
    },
