    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-2-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 Application of requirement to maintain Register/s",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-2-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nSection 23 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and\nService Standards) Act 1999 (which requires the ACA to maintain a\nRegister or Registers) does not apply to the ACA until:\n\n(a) 3 months after the day on which this Act receives the Royal\nAssent; or\n\n(b) such later day as the Minister determines in writing for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\n(2)\nA copy of a determination made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(b)\nmust be published in the Gazette.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nSection 23 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and\nService Standards) Act 1999 (which requires the ACA to maintain a\nRegister or Registers) does not apply to the ACA until:\n\n(a) 3 months after the day on which this Act receives the Royal\nAssent; or\n\n(b) such later day as the Minister determines in writing for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\n(2)\nA copy of a determination made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(b)\nmust be published in the Gazette.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-2-sec-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1e37a9968365e690ac5f8cbd6333215eaa6b7c049e246acbc8fc9cfd322f404a",
      "skos:note": "Application of requirement to maintain Register/s"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-2-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Application of requirement to maintain Register/s",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 102,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nSection 23 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and\nService Standards) Act 1999 (which requires the ACA to maintain a\nRegister or Registers) does not apply to the ACA until:\n\n(a) 3 months after the day on which this Act receives the Royal\nAssent; or\n\n(b) such later day as the Minister determines in writing for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\n(2)\nA copy of a determination made for the purposes of paragraph (1)(b)\nmust be published in the Gazette."
    },
