    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-3-sec-101a-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "101A(7) Penalty for late payment of levy",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-3-sec-101a-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.108",
      "values:originalText": "(7) As soon as practicable after a person fails to pay an amount of levy\nby the time by which it must be paid, the ACA must, in writing,\n\nConsequential and other amendments  Schedule 3\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000\nNo. 142, 2000            105\nnotify the person that the person is liable to a penalty under this\nsection. However, a failure to do so does not affect the person’s\nliability.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) As soon as practicable after a person fails to pay an amount of levy\nby the time by which it must be paid, the ACA must, in writing,\n\nConsequential and other amendments  Schedule 3\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000\nNo. 142, 2000            105\nnotify the person that the person is liable to a penalty under this\nsection. However, a failure to do so does not affect the person’s\nliability.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-3-sec-101a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-3-sec-101a-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-3-sec-101a-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9a894747e96bd42c3b23c648e8172b6d0ea86224c547d6e7e818fd073fef3a6e",
      "skos:note": "Notify person of liability for late payment of levy",
      "dc:description": "Writing"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-3-sec-101a-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "101A(7) Penalty for late payment of levy",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 108,
      "values:originalText": "(7) As soon as practicable after a person fails to pay an amount of levy\nby the time by which it must be paid, the ACA must, in writing,\n\nConsequential and other amendments  Schedule 3\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 2) 2000\nNo. 142, 2000            105\nnotify the person that the person is liable to a penalty under this\nsection. However, a failure to do so does not affect the person’s\nliability."
    },
