      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.112",
      "values:originalText": "In this Schedule:\nformer law means the Telecommunications Act 1997 as in force\nimmediately before the commencement of item 15 of Schedule 4 to the\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment Act 1999.",
      "skos:definition": "In this Schedule:\nformer law means the Telecommunications Act 1997 as in force\nimmediately before the commencement of item 15 of Schedule 4 to the\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment Act 1999.",
      "cml:asserts": [
