      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Meaning of former law",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 112,
      "values:originalText": "In this Schedule:\nformer law means the Telecommunications Act 1997 as in force\nimmediately before the commencement of item 15 of Schedule 4 to the\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment Act 1999."
    },
    {
