      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.116",
      "values:originalText": "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000\n(4)\nHowever, if the ACA has made an assessment based on the estimate,\nthe ACA is not required to change it if a return is later given to the\nACA.",
      "skos:definition": "(No. 2) 2000       No. 142, 2000\n(4)\nHowever, if the ACA has made an assessment based on the estimate,\nthe ACA is not required to change it if a return is later given to the\nACA.",
